<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of four-day English county championship matches starting on Thursday:</p>
<p>At Glamorgan: Glamorgan 114-5 v Sussex</p>
<p>At Southend: Derbyshire 142 (M.Ilott 7-59), Essex 157-2 (P.Prichard 71 not out, S.Law 69 not out)</p>
<p>Following matches did not start due to rain:</p>
<p>At Leicester: Leicestershire v Warwickshire</p>
<p>At Luton: Northamptonshire v Gloucestershire</p>
<p>At Worcester: Worcestershire v Lancashire</p>
<p>At Leeds (Headingley): Yorkshire v Middlesex</p>
</text>
